# idle-ping 開源 repo — .gitignore 草稿
# 用途：封鎖所有個人 / 運行數據檔案，防止複製時漏咗入 repo
# 生效：repo init 時改名做 .gitignore

# ===== 私隱紅線：身份同個人設定（永遠唔 commit）=====
soul/
SOUL.md
IDENTITY.md
USER.md
MEMORY.md
AGENTS.md
TOOLS.md
HEARTBEAT.md
CURIOSITY.md
THINKING.md
ARCHITECTURE.md

# ===== 對話紀錄 / 記憶 =====
memory/
sessions/
*.jsonl

# ===== 運行數據（curiosity）=====
curiosity/state.json
curiosity/prefs.json
curiosity/share-queue.db
curiosity/news-links.json
curiosity/news-digest.md
curiosity/system-activity.log
curiosity/patrol.log
curiosity/semantic.log
curiosity/watchdog.log
curiosity/dopamine-log.md
curiosity/topic-rotation.json
curiosity/topics.md
curiosity/channels.json
share-queue.db

# ===== 內部系統 =====
agent-drive/
.openclaw/
.clawhub/
config/
logs/
media/
avatars/
investments/
investment-framework.md
openclaw-workspace-state.json
PLAN-desire-drive.md

# ===== 憑證 / 環境變數 =====
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
openclaw.json

# ===== 暫存 / 備份 / 系統 =====
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.tmp
tmp-*
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
*.log

# ===== 內部計劃文件（唔入 public repo）=====
PURPOSE.md
INVENTORY.md
進度.md
流程圖.md
